the first trailer for Sonic was released  a few days ago  however the fan community hasn't been  able to get much out of the trailer so  far despite Jim Carrey's appearance as  villain dr. Ivo Robotnik the biggest  flaw seems to be the appearance of the  protagonist Sonic since many fans just  want a comic like look on the poster  released at the beginning of the year as  well as in this trailer Sonic seems more  like a hairy blue human being or as  Twitter user Kyle Olson quite accurately  illustrates more like the monkey from  Jumanji and even though many fans are  positively surprised by Jim Carrey's  performance this won't make them want to  go to the Sonic movie shortly afterwards  however director Jeff Fowler responded  who surprisingly handled the criticism  very constructively and announced on  Twitter that the design of Sonic would  be changed again nobody expected that so  quickly but the high number of dislikes  and the devastating comments seemed to  have had an effect was a simple change  of the eye area seems to help a lot  how Sega and Paramount will make the new  Sonic look like we will surely see in  the next trailer Sonic the Hedgehog will  be released on November 8 2019 with  Disney hiring James Gunn a few weeks ago  for the third part of guardians of the  galaxy to surprise to many fans the only  downside was that the shooting could not  start until 2021 at the earliest with  the finish of The Suicide Squad however  now The Hollywood Reporter reckons to  know that the filming of the third part  would begin in 2020 one of the reasons  for this is that James Gunn had already  finished the script before he was kicked  out of Disney so that production could  begin more or less directly if this were  to happen early next year the end of  2021 would be a realistic release date  for guardians of the galaxy 3 provided  Gunn takes over his previous script  seamlessly and the production of The  Suicide Squad is not delayed after not  only James Caan as director but also  some actors like Margot Robbie Jai  Courtney and Viola Davis will return to  The Suicide Squad reboot it became known  a few days ago that David s mao-chan  better known as curtain ant-man will  also be part of the cast death mao-chan  will take over the role of ethnic R'lyeh  a polka-dot man which makes him one of  the smaller villains in the Suicide  Squad  however the dots on his costume can turn  into powerful flying weapons like  circular saws furthermore there are  currently conversations going on with  Daniela Meltzer who is a possible female  version of rat catcher the Suicide Squad  is scheduled to be released in mid 2021  after some pictures of the upcoming  Rambo 5 last Blood have been released  recently  so the Wester Stallone a brush the fans  personally from the set the clip  consists of behind the scenes shots and  shows the lone carving arrows and other  things he also promises that fans can  look forward to a handmade film like the  first part what exactly this means is  not sure however the first part goes  mostly without CGI fireworks the plot  will revolve around Gabriela the  daughter of John Rambo's housekeeper  because after she was kidnapped by a  Mexican woman trader cartel the retired  John Rambo decides that it has to take  care of the situation himself and save  Gabriela  you can also hope for a trailer soon  after all Rambo 5 last blood will be  released in the cinemas on September  20th 2019 after four published  videogames the Saints Row series will  now also be made into a film Saints Row  4 was the latest release for PC and  console in 2013 now several companies  have teamed up to produce a movie from  the popular series among them is the  German company coffe which not only owns  the rights to the video game series but  was also responsible for the latest  releases Saints Row 4 and Saints Row get  out of hell f Gary great who has already  been involved behind the scenes in  action movies like The Italian Job is  also supposed to be part of it in  addition grey is currently working for  men in black International and also had  a hand in Straight Outta Compton so he  doesn't have a lack of qualification  Greg Russo was hired as screenwriter and  has worked among others on Resident Evil  and Mortal Kombat so in fact they have  found some quite skilled people but  nevertheless many fans will be skeptical  about the filming of Saints Row after  all filmed video games have very often  disappointed the high expectations of  the fans the originally plans started  for fantastic beast 3 was supposed to be  November 2020 however it has now turned  out that fans of the Harry Potter  spin-off will have to wait longer  and this despite the big announcement of  Warner prior to the first part namely  that every two years from 2016 to 2020  for a new beasts movie will be released  however due to time difficulties the  release will be delayed by a whole year  a representative of Warner commented as  follows we are excited about the Beast  series and have complete faith in it we  believe that the new release date will  give the producers the time and space to  fully develop their art and deliver the  best possible film to our fans  this means the shooting will be delayed  and instead of starting in july 2019  there will not begin until spring 2020  whether the wait will at least have been  worth will be seen in november 2021 when  fantastic ps3 will start in the cinemas  [Music]
 

